  "body": "?Commanding an elevated position in one of the North Shore’s most tightly held enclaves, this bespoke MDS-designed residence represents the pinnacle of contemporary executive living. Completed in 2018, the 368 sqm  (more or less) home makes an immediate architectural statement, pairing striking, enduring concrete and cedar exteriors with a meticulously engineered, low-maintenance 601 sqm (more or less) freehold parcel.\r\n\r\n?Every line and proportion has been conceived to celebrate the spectacular panorama across Lake Pupuke while prioritizing effortless day-to-day functionality. The expansive primary living domain is anchored by a sculptural central island and designer kitchen—complete with a full butler’s scullery—oriented specifically to frame the water views. Anchored by warm American oak flooring and ambient fireplaces, the formal and informal living zones transition seamlessly through floor-to-ceiling sliders to a Louvre-tec covered alfresco terrace, creating a true all-season entertaining sanctuary.\r\n\r\n?Intelligently configured to adapt to every stage of family life—from executive couples to large or multi-generational households—the versatile floorplan offers five generous double bedrooms and three luxury ensuites, ensuring uncompromising privacy and separation.\r\n\r\n?Privately secured behind automated gates and full perimeter fencing, the residence offers a lock-up-and-leave lifestyle without sacrificing scale or prestige. Positioned within Auckland’s premier educational belt—zoned for Westlake Boys, Westlake Girls, and Takapuna Grammar—and located just 17 minutes from the CBD, this is a rare offering of architectural pedigree, superior materiality, and blue-chip convenience.\r\n\r\n?Property Highlights:?\r\n• Architectural Pedigree: Designed by MDS (2018); 368 sqm (more or less) floor area on a low-maintenance 601 sqm (more or less) freehold site.?\r\n• Superior Materiality: Solid concrete and cedar construction, rich American oak flooring, and bespoke joinery.?\r\n• View-Focused Living: Entertainer’s kitchen with statement central island, full scullery, multiple living areas with fireplaces, and Louvre-tec covered outdoor living.\r\n• ?Versatile Family Layout: Five double bedrooms, three ensuites, and double internal-access garaging tailored for effortless multi-generational living.?\r\n• Blue-Chip Location: Gated security, premier school zoning (Westlake Boys & Girls, Takapuna Grammar), and a 17-minute commute to the Auckland CBD.?\r\n• Vendor On The Move — Clear Instruction to Sell: Currently in the midst of relocating and eager to embark on their next chapter, our vendor is decisively on the move with clear instructions to sell. Fully prepared to meet the market, the vendor is genuinely motivated to achieve a swift result—discerning buyers are strongly encouraged to inspect early and present their offers with confidence.",
